WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:02.633
1,677 short posts since March

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.500
2018. Every one a star.

00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:07.033
Most are written late. Peak

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.067
hour, 11 pm. 700 of them

00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:10.000
after dark.

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:12.600
Two languages: 1,181 in

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:15.000
English, 344 in Marathi.

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:18.667
2020 was the loudest year:

00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:20.000
535 posts.

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:22.400
The first post: Act today in

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:24.633
such a way that you need not

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.000
to regret tomorrow.

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:29.433
Written after dark. Read any

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.000
time.
